  "_note": "Per-swap ERC-20 HTLC. Funded by a plain token transfer to the CREATE address (no allowance is ever created); claim/refund sweep balanceOf. claim() requires balanceOf >= amount before revealing the preimage. The Claimed(bytes32) event keeps the preimage NON-INDEXED because pyrxd scrapes the secret from the log data.",
